column29:
Currently, when downloading the *DC Cases Sold Report*, the CSV file is downloaded with the incorrect file name:

{{distributor-dc-report}}

Please update the exported CSV file name to:

{{distributor-dc-cases-sold-report}}

*Expected Result:*
Downloaded CSV file name should be:

{{distributor-dc-cases-sold-report.csv}}

*Current Result:*
Downloaded CSV file name is:

{{distributor-dc-report.csv}}

See Bubbies 2026 Forecast for AIT for layout. There are several tabs for Revenue and Cases. The Report is missing Actuals as well as Variance number between Planned and Actuals.  The report should be dynamic and allow the user to toggle filters for 

* {color:#006644}Planned Non Promoted Cases {color}
* {color:#006644}Planned Promoted Cases {color}
* {color:#006644}Planned Cases Total {color}
* {color:#403294}Actual Non Promoted Cases {color}
* {color:#403294}Actual Promoted Cases {color}
* {color:#403294}Actual Cases Total {color}
* {color:#008da6}Planned Non Promoted Revenue{color}
* {color:#008da6}Planned Promoted Revenue{color}
* {color:#008da6}Planned Revenue Total {color}
* {color:#4c9aff}Actual Non Promoted Revenue {color}
* {color:#4c9aff}Actual Promoted Revenue {color}
* {color:#4c9aff}Actual Revenue Total {color}

*Provide a Variance for each Cases & Revenue* 

* Planned Non Promo to Actual Non Promo Variance  
* Planned Promo to Actual Promo Total Variance  
* Planned Total to Actual Total Variance  

*The Data for Planned Cases & Planned Revenue* 

* Comes from *Trade Spend Sandbox* or *Trade Spend Brand Approved*. Note: Can the User Choose in the report?  

*The Data for Actual Cases & Actual Revenue* 

* *Need to Discuss.* Originally we discussed that this data would come from the distributor. The problem is that KEHE does not report discounted sales prices 
* If the Brand has SPINS data we use SPINS data to record the number of units sold during the time period of the promotional event. This can be done by calculations or SPINS defines a set of measures that can be used. ARP, ARP any Promo, Dols. Any Promo, Dols non promo Units any Promo Units Non promo  

*Example Report images for Inspiration.* 

This is currently in Caboodle but the pie chart isn’t the right chart for this data 

