30/Apr/25 6:39 PM;63b1b2f4741248746bf7244c;[~accountid:5d89a90316bcf20dd1c6251a] The ticket is resolved from my end. I’ve created the PR but it’s not approved yet. I’ll let you know as soon as it gets approved.

Anyways, I’ve done few adjustments. I’ve changed the URL for importing and exporting Brands from admin side. Updated URLs are:

{{api/v1/brands/import}}

{{api/v1/brands/export}}

Please make adjustments accordingly on your end as well. If there’s any inconsistencies please let me know.

06/Apr/25 4:48 PM;63b1b2f4741248746bf7244c;[~accountid:5d89a90316bcf20dd1c6251a] I have made little changes in mentioned endpoint.

{noformat}api/v1/distributors/{distributorID}/banners{noformat}

Instead of using two separate properties for Banner and Retailer search, consider utilizing a single property named 'SearchString' that enables users to search by either Banner or Retailer name.

